msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "There are three statuses - Love, Friendship, and Hate."
msgstr "Il y a trois statuts : Amour, Amitié et Haine."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian/0/g-0/40 dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_front/0/g-0/40 dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_back/0/g-0/40 dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_tiny/0/g-0/40 dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_trap/0/g-0/43
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Love can get you toward some really special paths for those you are truly interested in..."
msgstr "L'Amour peut t'ouvrir des chemins vraiment spéciaux avec ceux qui t'intéressent pour de vrai..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian/0/g-0/48
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "But it's not necessarily the best of the options in my mind."
msgstr "Mais à mon sens, ce n'est pas forcément la meilleure des options."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian/0/g-0/56 dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_front/0/g-0/56 dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_back/0/g-0/56 dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_tiny/0/g-0/56 dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_trap/0/g-0/59
