#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian/0/g-0/72
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I've seen the complications of love. I've lived through the jealous quarrels of hate."
msgstr "J'ai vu les complications de l'amour. J'ai vécu les querelles jalouses de la haine."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian/0/g-0/80
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "The true bond is one between two friends with none of the intricacies of romantic tension."
msgstr "Le vrai lien, c'est celui entre deux amis, sans les subtilités de la tension romantique."

