# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_back/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "Love? What a gas."
msgstr "L'amour ? Elle est bien bonne."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_back/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "I believe everyone here should be friends."
msgstr "Moi, je crois qu'on devrait tous être amis, ici."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_back/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "I'll believe it when I see it."
msgstr "Je demande à voir."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_back/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "You hear that?? Chaos Reborn?"
msgstr "T'as entendu ça ?? Le chaos fait chair ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_back/0/c-3/7 dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_back/0/g-0/120
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "Human, you seem like a good sort. So we'll be friends, for now."
msgstr "{{Humain|Humaine|Humain·e}}, tu m'as l'air réglo. Alors on sera amis, pour le moment."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_back/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "We get a little knackered by using this newfangled dateviator rubbish, y'see."
msgstr "Ça nous lessive un peu, ces nouvelles bidouilles de Dateviators, tu vois."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_back/0/g-0/48
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "But it's not necessarily the best of the options in my mind."
msgstr "Mais à mon sens, ce n'est pas forcément la meilleure des options."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_back/0/g-0/64
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "If everyone were friends, the world would be an awful lot safer in my opinion."
msgstr "Si on était tous amis, le monde serait sacrément plus sûr, à mon avis."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_back/0/g-0/72
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "I've seen the complications of love. I've lived through the jealous quarrels of hate."
msgstr "J'ai vu les complications de l'amour. J'ai vécu les querelles jalouses de la haine."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_back/0/g-0/80
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "The true bond is one between two friends with none of those intricacies of romantic tension."
msgstr "Le vrai lien, c'est celui entre deux amis, sans toutes ces subtilités de la tension romantique."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_back/0/g-0/104
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "You speakin' of Reggie?"
msgstr "Tu parles de Reggie, là ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_back/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "You wear it well."
msgstr "Ça te va bien."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_back/0/g-0/c-4/15
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "Trust me - I can see even though I'm facing the other way."
msgstr "Fais-moi confiance : je vois, même tourné de l'autre côté."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_back/0/g-1/19
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "Duty calls, love."
msgstr "Le devoir m'appelle, mon chou."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_tiny/0/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You're still standing in your house, but there is an unbelievable amount of bouncer energy radiating from the stranger who's just appeared in front of you."
msgstr "Vous êtes toujours chez vous, mais une incroyable aura de videur émane de l'inconnu qui vient d'apparaître devant vous."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_tiny/0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Which is genuinely impressive considering just how <i>short</i> he is."
msgstr "Ce qui est franchement impressionnant, vu à quel point il est <i>petit</i>."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_tiny/0/13
msgctxt "Tiny Dorian"
msgid "No funny business. I don't want to see those spectacles being used for something untoward."
msgstr "Pas d'entourloupe. Je ne veux pas voir ces lunettes servir à quoi que ce soit de louche."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_tiny/0/43
msgctxt "Tiny Dorian"
msgid "You sure about that?"
msgstr "Ah oui, vraiment ?"

