msgstr "Je me sentais tellement seul, bordel !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_complete_reggie_needed/0/53 dorian_door/dorian_complete_reggie_needed_front/0/53 dorian_door/dorian_complete_reggie_needed_back/0/53 dorian_door/dorian_complete_reggie_needed_tiny/0/53 dorian_door/dorian_complete_reggie_needed_trap/0/50 dorian_door/dorian_complete_reggie_needed_realized/0/72
