#: dorian_door/dorian_friend_thanks_back/25
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "Keep it up - it feels better and better the more you do, trust me."
msgstr "Continue comme ça : plus tu en fais, plus c'est agréable, crois-moi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_low_back/6
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "You've made some good friends in here. I respect the hustle."
msgstr "Tu t'es fait de bons amis, ici. Je respecte l'effort."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_low_back/17
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "In my view, friendship is all about good boundaries. Right in between the dizzying heights of love and the minefield of hatred."
msgstr "Selon moi, l'amitié, c'est une affaire de bonnes limites. Pile entre les hauteurs vertigineuses de l'amour et le champ de mines de la haine."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_medium_back/6
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "I can tell you have been working your way towards becoming friends with everyone here."
msgstr "Je vois bien que tu t'efforces de te lier d'amitié avec tout le monde ici."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_medium_back/14
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "The house is settling down, becoming calm. Keeping in order."
msgstr "La maison s'apaise, retrouve son calme. L'ordre règne."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_medium_back/25
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "I feel I can trust you with this."
msgstr "Je sens que je peux te confier ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_medium_back/33
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "You are a soldier with me. But more than that, someone I can rely on."
msgstr "Tu es un soldat à mes côtés. Mais plus que ça, quelqu'un sur qui je peux compter."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_medium_back/41/b/1
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "Thank you, friend."
msgstr "Merci, mon pote."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_medium_back/44/b/1
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "Thank you, my love."
msgstr "Merci, mon amour."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_hot_back/6
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "More friends all around... The quest you are on increases in intensity."
msgstr "Toujours plus d'amis... La quête que tu mènes gagne en intensité."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_hot_back/17
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "But there is an end in sight. I know you can see it through."
msgstr "Mais la fin est en vue. Je sais que tu peux aller jusqu'au bout."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_hot_back/25
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "Now then, where were we?"
msgstr "Bon, alors, où en étions-nous ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_spicy_back/6
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "A peace settles across the land. I see few problems to take care of."
msgstr "Une paix s'installe sur le pays. Je ne vois plus guère de problèmes à régler."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_spicy_back/17
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "My stiff back feels like it can relax ... but not yet. Not while we are so close."
msgstr "Mon dos raide a l'impression de pouvoir se détendre... mais pas encore. Pas alors que nous sommes si près du but."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_spicy_back/25
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "Keep it up, comrade."
msgstr "Continue comme ça, camarade."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_spicy_back/33
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "Now then, the matter at hand."
msgstr "Bon, passons à l'affaire qui nous occupe."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_complete_reggie_needed_back/0/0
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "Well, I'm rather impressed. You've gotten almost every single dateable as a friend..."
msgstr "Eh bien, je suis plutôt impressionné. Tu as gagné l'amitié de presque tous les datables..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_complete_reggie_needed_back/0/11
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "And you've done so well, in fact, that you've completely missed one out."
msgstr "Et tu as si bien travaillé, en fait, que tu en as complètement oublié un."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_complete_reggie_needed_back/0/19
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "The one who appears when you've gotten a hate ending... Reggie Rejection."
msgstr "Celui qui apparaît quand tu obtiens une fin Haine... Reggie Rejection."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_complete_back/0/8/b/1
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "You've done it. 100 Friends... all across the house."
msgstr "Tu as réussi. 100 amitiés... dans toute la maison."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_complete_back/0/11/b/1
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "You've done it. All Friends... throughout the house."
msgstr "Tu as réussi. Rien que des amis... dans toute la maison."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_complete_back/0/14
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "I stand awestruck at your capabilities."
msgstr "Je suis émerveillé par tes capacités."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_complete_back/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "More than nothing! It's everything! Literally..."
msgstr "Plus que rien ! C'est tout ! Littéralement..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_complete_back/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "I mean it."
msgstr "Je suis sincère."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_complete_back/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "I do enjoy friendship but... I admit I have difficulties making friends myself."
msgstr "J'adore l'amitié, mais... j'avoue avoir moi-même du mal à me faire des amis."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_complete_back/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dorian looks off to the side—you can't see his face, but he seems to be deep in thought about something."
msgstr "Dorian regarde sur le côté. Vous ne voyez pas son visage, mais il semble plongé dans ses pensées."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_complete_back/0/g-0/5
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "If you... well."
msgstr "Si tu... enfin."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_complete_back/0/g-0/13
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "Wanted to."
msgstr "Le voulais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_complete_back/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "I could show you the way to my heart..."
msgstr "Je pourrais te montrer le chemin de mon coeur..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_complete_back/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "Dreams... do come true."
msgstr "Les rêves... deviennent réalité."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_complete_back/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dorian pauses for so long you wonder if you've messed things up. If you could only see his face... you begin to regret having this conversation at the back door."
msgstr "Dorian marque une pause si longue que vous vous demandez si vous avez tout gâché. Si seulement vous pouviez voir son visage... Vous commencez à regretter d'avoir eu cette conversation à la porte de derrière."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_complete_back/0/g-0/c-3/23
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "You've gone and done it."
msgstr "T'as fini par le faire."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_complete_back/0/g-0/c-3/31
msgctxt "Back Dorian"
msgid "You've made this ol' door cry."
msgstr "Tu as fait pleurer cette vieille porte."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_friend_thanks_tiny/6
