# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_path/0/4
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Unbelievable."
msgstr "Incroyable."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_path/0/12
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "You've explored every inch of me. All my forms and shapes."
msgstr "Tu as exploré chaque centimètre de moi. Toutes mes formes et mes silhouettes."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_path/0/20
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "...I try to come off as intimidating, but now I feel a bit exposed."
msgstr "... J'essaie d'avoir l'air intimidant, mais là, je me sens un peu mis à nu."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_path/0/31/s/0 dorian_door/dorian_love_path_front/0/31/s/0 dorian_door/dorian_love_path_back/0/42/s/0 dorian_door/dorian_love_path_tiny/0/39/s/0 dorian_door/dorian_love_path_trap/0/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "All according to plan. I love you."
msgstr "Tout se passe comme prévu. Je t'aime."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_path/0/32/s/0 dorian_door/dorian_love_path_front/0/32/s/0 dorian_door/dorian_love_path_back/0/43/s/0 dorian_door/dorian_love_path_tiny/0/40/s/0 dorian_door/dorian_love_path_trap/0/45/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I just like exploring actually. You're not really my type."
msgstr "En fait, j'aime juste explorer. T'es pas vraiment mon genre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_path/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I told you, I am distrustful of love because of its ability to break your heart."
msgstr "Je te l'ai dit : je me méfie de l'amour, parce qu'il peut te briser le coeur."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_path/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I value friendship because I can rely on it."
msgstr "Je tiens à l'amitié parce que je peux compter dessus."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_path/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "But you are showing me that I can rely on you."
msgstr "Mais toi, tu me montres que je peux compter sur toi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_path/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I'm big and strong to keep the bad ones out."
msgstr "Je suis grand et fort pour tenir les méchants à l'écart."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_path/0/c-0/39
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "But that doesn't mean I can't hold you tighter than anyone else in this house."
msgstr "Mais ça ne m'empêche pas de te serrer plus fort que n'importe qui dans cette maison."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_path/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Well that, certainly makes me relieved. For a moment there, I felt the old pangs of love, but fortunately it's reliable friendship that I was feeling."
msgstr "Eh bien, me voilà soulagé. Un instant, j'ai cru ressentir les vieux tiraillements de l'amour, mais heureusement, c'était une solide amitié que je ressentais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_path/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "You're one of the good ones. I'm honored to be your mate."
msgstr "Tu fais partie des gens bien. Je suis honoré d'être ton pote."

