#: dorian_door/dorian_love_path_trap/0/39
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It's hard not to stare at his bare chest as he says the word 'exposed'. He's doing this on purpose, surely."
msgstr "Difficile de ne pas fixer son torse nu quand il prononce les mots « mis à nu ». Il le fait exprès, forcément."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_path_trap/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Trap Dorian"
msgid "I told you, I am distrustful of love because of its ability to break your heart."
msgstr "Je te l'ai dit : je me méfie de l'amour, parce qu'il peut te briser le coeur."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_path_trap/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Trap Dorian"
msgid "I value friendship because I can rely on it."
msgstr "Je tiens à l'amitié parce que je peux compter dessus."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_path_trap/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Trap Dorian"
msgid "But you are showing me that I can rely on you."
msgstr "Mais toi, tu me montres que je peux compter sur toi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_path_trap/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Trap Dorian"
msgid "I'm big and strong to keep the bad ones out."
msgstr "Je suis grand et fort pour tenir les méchants à l'écart."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_path_trap/0/c-0/39
msgctxt "Trap Dorian"
msgid "But that doesn't mean I can't hold you tighter than anyone else in this house."
msgstr "Mais ça ne m'empêche pas de te serrer plus fort que n'importe qui dans cette maison."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_path_trap/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Trap Dorian"
msgid "Oh... it's the clothes, innit?"
msgstr "Oh... c'est les vêtements, pas vrai ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_path_trap/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Trap Dorian"
msgid "Well that certainly makes me relieved. For a moment there I felt the old pangs of love, but fortunately it's reliable friendship that I was feeling."
msgstr "Eh bien, me voilà soulagé. Un instant, j'ai cru ressentir les vieux tiraillements de l'amour, mais heureusement, c'était une solide amitié que je ressentais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_path_trap/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Trap Dorian"
msgid "You're one of the good ones. I'm honored to be your mate."
msgstr "Tu fais partie des gens bien. Je suis honoré d'être ton pote."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_return/0/0
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "My darling. You've opened the way to my heart."
msgstr "Mon trésor. Tu as ouvert le chemin de mon coeur."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_return/0/8
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Come to me."
msgstr "Viens à moi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_return/0/16/s/0 dorian_door/dorian_love_return_front/0/16/s/0 dorian_door/dorian_love_return_back/0/16/s/0 dorian_door/dorian_love_return_tiny/0/16/s/0 dorian_door/dorian_love_return_trap/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm open wide..."
msgstr "Je suis {{grand ouvert|grande ouverte|grand·e ouvert·e}}..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "That's the best way to be."
msgstr "C'est la meilleure façon d'être."

