# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_realize_begin/6/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Okay Dorian - you're up first. Will you be our gateway to a new world?"
msgstr "OK Dorian, tu passes en premier. Tu veux bien être notre porte d'entrée vers un nouveau monde ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_realize_begin/9
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Knock knock, Dorian. Here comes a whole new form!"
msgstr "Toc toc, Dorian. Voici une toute nouvelle forme !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_realize_begin/20
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely a door, becomes...."
msgstr "L'énergie spectrale traverse vos Dateviators, et ce qui n'était qu'une porte devient..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_realized/0/3
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "At long last... I stand as a human."
msgstr "Enfin... me voici debout, en humain."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_realized/0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How do you feel?"
msgstr "Comment tu te sens ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_realized/0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Cool!"
msgstr "Cool !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_realized/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "... a bit wet. Squidgy."
msgstr "... un peu humide. Spongieux."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_realized/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "It is cool."
msgstr "C'est cool, oui."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_realized/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "There's something I have been looking forward to trying for a very long time."
msgstr "Il y a une chose que j'attends d'essayer depuis très longtemps."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_realized/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "From out of his pocket, Dorian pulls a jump-rope. How that got in there is a miracle of dateviator technology."
msgstr "De sa poche, Dorian sort une corde à sauter. Comment est-elle arrivée là ? Un miracle de la technologie des Dateviators."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_realized/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dorian gives the jump-rope a firm squeeze, then proceeds to hop in place for around 30 seconds."
msgstr "Dorian empoigne fermement la corde à sauter, puis se met à sautiller sur place pendant une trentaine de secondes."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_realized/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He stops, and looks around."
msgstr "Il s'arrête et regarde autour de lui."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_realized/0/g-0/29
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Well, that was quite fun."
msgstr "Eh bien, c'était plutôt amusant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_realized/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I think I'm done here."
msgstr "Je crois que j'en ai fini ici."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_realized/0/g-0/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay!"
msgstr "OK !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_realized/0/g-0/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What about consummating our relationship...? Does that hold any interest?"
msgstr "Et si on consommait notre relation... ? Ça t'intéresse ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_divert/3
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Absolutely it does."
msgstr "Absolument."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_divert/11
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I thought you'd never ask..."
msgstr "Je croyais que tu ne demanderais jamais..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_divert/19
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I like to keep it professional. But if you say so - I'm all yours."
msgstr "J'aime rester professionnel. Mais si tu le dis, je suis tout à toi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_divert/30
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dorian may insist he keeps things professional, but he takes to lovemaking with a shocking passion. Gone is the immovable, stone-faced door who once guarded the rooms of your house—there's only a warm and generous lover left in his stead."
msgstr "Dorian a beau prétendre rester professionnel, il s'adonne à l'amour avec une passion stupéfiante. Disparue, la porte inébranlable au visage de marbre qui gardait les pièces de votre maison : il ne reste plus qu'un amant chaleureux et généreux."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_divert/38
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dorian is attentive and courteous, putting his considerable strength into ensuring your every desire is fulfilled. When he departs the next morning there's an echo of his old self in the stoic expression he wears, but when he kisses your forehead he's just as gentle and sweet as he'd been the night before."
msgstr "Dorian est attentionné et courtois, et met sa force considérable au service de chacun de vos désirs. Quand il s'en va le lendemain matin, son expression stoïque garde un écho de son ancien lui, mais lorsqu'il vous embrasse sur le front, il est tout aussi doux et tendre que la veille."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_join/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dorian places his hands on the front door frame as he looks back into your house one last time."
msgstr "Dorian pose les mains sur le chambranle de la porte d'entrée et jette un dernier regard à l'intérieur de votre maison."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_join/0/8
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Stay strong."
msgstr "Tiens bon."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_join/0/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He turns to go."
msgstr "Il se retourne pour partir."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_join/0/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Let him leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>Le laisser partir.</i>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_join/0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait!"
msgstr "Attends !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_join/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Eh?"
msgstr "Hein ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_join/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What are you going to do?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce que tu vas faire ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_join/0/c-1/15/c-0/18
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "There's only one path for me."
msgstr "Il n'y a qu'un seul chemin pour moi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_love_join/0/c-1/15/c-0/26
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "When you're ready - I'll see you on the other side."
msgstr "Quand tu seras {{prêt|prête|prêt·e}}, on se retrouvera de l'autre côté."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_keith_realize/0/0
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I saw it happen."
msgstr "Je l'ai vu de mes yeux."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_keith_realize/0/8/s/0 dorian_door/dorian_keith_realize_front/0/8/s/0 dorian_door/dorian_keith_realize_back/0/8/s/0 dorian_door/dorian_keith_realize_tiny/0/8/s/0 dorian_door/dorian_keith_realize_trap/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Quoi ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_keith_realize/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Keith."
msgstr "Keith."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_keith_realize/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "My old mate."
msgstr "Mon vieux pote."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_keith_realize/0/g-0/0/s/0 dorian_door/dorian_keith_realize_front/0/g-0/0/s/0 dorian_door/dorian_keith_realize_back/0/g-0/0/s/0 dorian_door/dorian_keith_realize_tiny/0/g-0/0/s/0 dorian_door/dorian_keith_realize_trap/0/g-0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I never trusted that guy..."
msgstr "Je n'ai jamais fait confiance à ce type..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_keith_realize/0/g-0/1/s/0 dorian_door/dorian_keith_realize_front/0/g-0/1/s/0 dorian_door/dorian_keith_realize_back/0/g-0/1/s/0 dorian_door/dorian_keith_realize_tiny/0/g-0/1/s/0 dorian_door/dorian_keith_realize_trap/0/g-0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I can't believe that happened..."
msgstr "Je n'arrive pas à croire que ça soit arrivé..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_keith_realize/0/g-0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Oh really? So I'm a bit daft in believing that he was my friend?"
msgstr "Ah oui ? Alors je suis un peu benêt d'avoir cru qu'il était mon ami ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_keith_realize/0/g-0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "You're quite smart, aren't you? You should be proud of yourself."
msgstr "T'es {{malin|maligne|malin·e}}, hein ? Tu dois être {{fier|fière|fier·ère}} de toi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_keith_realize/0/g-0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I'm just the one here bad at seeing a master manipulator at work."
msgstr "C'est juste moi, ici, qui ne sais pas repérer un manipulateur de génie en action."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_keith_realize/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Goes to show that sometimes friends aren't what you believe them to be."
msgstr "Ça prouve que parfois, les amis ne sont pas ce qu'on croit."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_keith_realize/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I'll have to have about this."
msgstr "Il va falloir que je réfléchisse à tout ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_keith_realize/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I have to be more solid - more foundationally secure in who I attach myself to."
msgstr "Je dois être plus solide. Mieux ancré dans le choix de ceux à qui je m'attache."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_keith_realize/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "You..."
msgstr "Toi..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dorian_door/dorian_keith_realize/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "You don't have any wayward plans... do you?"
msgstr "Tu n'as pas de projets tordus... hein ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
